# ---- answers to the newbie questions -------------------------------------------------------
@kind reply
@who *
@answers ask_xpneeded
fill the bar ten bubbles and you ding
each bubble is a tenth, watch them fill
@answers ask_findgroup
post your level and class in lfg and wait a bit
ask whoever is camping near your level
@answers ask_power
sit between pulls, it comes back way faster
pace your pulls and med when you need to
@answers ask_merchant
sell to whoever is closest, they all pay the same
grey stuff goes to any merchant, keep upgrades
@answers ask_bind
the bindstone is in town, stand next to it and /bind
if you die you go back to your bind, so bind close
@answers ask_realmability
those come later, realm points from the frontier buy them
your trainer sells them once you have realm points
@answers ask_train
visit your trainer when you ding and spend the points
the trainer in town takes your spec points
@answers ask_camps
find mobs that con blue or yellow and stay there
say your level in faction and someone will point you to a spot
@answers ask_campshare
just ask nicely, most will share
ask first, then take turns on pulls
@answers ask_bags
sell what you dont use, bags fill fast
keep upgrades, sell the rest to a merchant
@answers ask_guards
run to the guards if a pull goes bad
guards help, lead the bad ones back to them
@answers ask_lfg
lfg is looking for group, add your level and class
it means someone wants a group
@answers ask_guild
watch for guild recruiting, it happens every night
send a tell to someone wearing a guild tag
@answers ask_safezone
home zones are safe, the enemy is in the frontier
you are fine here, enemies stay in the frontier
@answers ask_pulling
pull one at a time and back off to your spot
pull with a ranged spell or arrow if you have one
@answers ask_craft
pick one craft and stick with it, it adds up
talk to the craft trainer in town to start
